# AutoDub product rules

Public/private git hygiene (`holdout/`, `operator/`, `.env`) is governed by the **global** rule `holdout-and-secrets` — follow that; do not restate it here.

## Product invariants

- When EN captions exist: spoken text = caption text (no invented lines).
- Do not redistribute episode files or AutoDub masters from this project.
- Do not add DRM decryption / stream-ripping helpers.
- Prefer prior-art glue over rewriting dub pipelines from scratch.
- `cast/examples/` = schema + fake IDs only; real cast bindings live under local `operator/cast/`.
